{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-60326","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90027","text":"FleetPrompt — The Open Agent Marketplace"}]},{"id":"blk-60327","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90028","text":"Discover, publish, and install production-ready AI agents. Built on trust scores, versioned manifests, and one-click deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-60328","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90029","text":"Source-of-truth spec"}]},{"id":"blk-60329","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60331","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90030","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-90031","text":" — FleetPrompt technical specification"}]}],"id":"blk-60330","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60333","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90032","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/BUILD.md"},{"id":"spn-90033","text":" — Implementation build prompt (9 phases)"}]}],"id":"blk-60332","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60334","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90034","text":"Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-60335","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8 (LiveView for UI, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migrations 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-60336","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90035","text":"Build commands"}]},{"id":"blk-60337","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"mix deps.get\nmix compile --warnings-as-errors\nmix format --check-formatted\nmix test                          # requires running Supabase for DB tests\nmix test test/fleet_prompt/       # unit tests (no DB required for most)"},{"id":"blk-60338","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90036","text":"Key modules"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-60340","spans":[{"id":"spn-90037","text":"Module"}]},{"id":"blk-60341","spans":[{"id":"spn-90038","text":"Purpose"}]}],"id":"blk-60339","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-60342","spans":[{"id":"spn-90039","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Registry"}]},{"id":"blk-60343","spans":[{"id":"spn-90040","text":"Agent + manifest CRUD, version immutability, status transitions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60344","spans":[{"id":"spn-90041","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-60345","spans":[{"id":"spn-90042","text":"4-signal weighted trust computation (test 30%, spec 25%, usage 25%, audit 20%)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60346","spans":[{"id":"spn-90043","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Worker"}]},{"id":"blk-60347","spans":[{"id":"spn-90044","text":"GenServer per agent — recomputes, caches in ETS, broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60348","spans":[{"id":"spn-90045","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Supervisor"}]},{"id":"blk-60349","spans":[{"id":"spn-90046","text":"DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60350","spans":[{"id":"spn-90047","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search"}]},{"id":"blk-60351","spans":[{"id":"spn-90048","text":"pg_trgm + ts_vector full-text search with filters"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60352","spans":[{"id":"spn-90049","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Forks"}]},{"id":"blk-60353","spans":[{"id":"spn-90050","text":"Fork-and-customize with provenance tracking"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60354","spans":[{"id":"spn-90051","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake"}]},{"id":"blk-60355","spans":[{"id":"spn-90052","text":"ConsolidationEvent processing from Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60356","spans":[{"id":"spn-90053","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.InstallEngine"}]},{"id":"blk-60357","spans":[{"id":"spn-90054","text":"Install flow with permission checks"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60358","spans":[{"id":"spn-90055","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.AuditWriter"}]},{"id":"blk-60359","spans":[{"id":"spn-90056","text":"Append-only audit event recording"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60360","spans":[{"id":"spn-90057","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher"}]},{"id":"blk-60361","spans":[{"id":"spn-90058","text":"Oban worker for async webhook delivery"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60362","spans":[{"id":"spn-90059","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Cache"}]},{"id":"blk-60363","spans":[{"id":"spn-90060","text":"ETS GenServer with 4 named tables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60364","spans":[{"id":"spn-90061","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.MCP.Server"}]},{"id":"blk-60365","spans":[{"id":"spn-90062","text":"MCP JSON-RPC server (7 tools)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-60366","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90063","text":"Supabase schema"}]},{"id":"blk-60367","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90064","text":"Tables live in "},{"id":"spn-90065","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.*"},{"id":"spn-90066","text":" schema (migrations 030-039 in "},{"id":"spn-90067","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-supabase/migrations/"},{"id":"spn-90068","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-60368","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60370","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90069","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.publishers"},{"id":"spn-90070","text":" — marketplace publisher profiles"}]}],"id":"blk-60369","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90071","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agents"},{"id":"spn-90072","text":" — agent listings with search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-60371","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90073","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agent_versions"},{"id":"spn-90074","text":" — semver-versioned releases with JSONB manifest"}]}],"id":"blk-60373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90075","marks":["code